Z||000006||Dave Gunsul||08-14-2001||08:26 PM||||If you flip back a page or two you'll see<BR>Formulas post from saturday about his carbed 3.2 he answered my questions about this same idea. Formula used an early Blazer/s-10 distributor, Holley 390 cfm (part # 0-8007)<BR>and Edelbrock manifold.<BR>You may want to wait on the distributor though. I am emailing a company that I think sells one of these with a custom advance curve and many other perf. perks.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
